coverage/
dist/
tmp/
.preview/

# The demo page and its link card are BUILT, not committed: .github/workflows/pages.yml
# runs `make-og` + `build-demo` on every push to main and deploys the result. Committing
# them means a stale page in the repo that disagrees with the one that is actually live —
# and `og.png` is 125 KB of binary that would be rewritten on every content change.
# Build it locally with `npm run og && npm run demo`.
site/
